      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><h3>Avoid Costly Mistakes: Essential Checks Before Moving</h3><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Relocating is a significant life event, yet the relocation industry is rife with pitfalls that can turn a stressful process into a financial nightmare.</p>
