    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Pune to Chennai | Express Container Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes packers and movers pune to chennai the best choice for car transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our service combines a dedicated fleet of hydraulic‑ramp carriers, ISO‑9001:2015 quality management, and a 4.9/5 Google rating. Each vehicle is secured with a 4‑wheel lock, edge padding, and live GPS tracking, ensuring zero‑scratch delivery across the 1,189 km Pune‑to‑Chennai corridor.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a car shipment from Pune to Chennai typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit time averages 28‑32 hours, depending on traffic and weather along NH‑16. Our real‑time tracking updates allow customers to monitor progress, and we schedule loading and unloading within agreed windows to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for moving a car from Pune to Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need the original RC book, insurance certificate, valid pollution under‑control (PUC) certificate, a signed transport agreement, and an e‑Way bill for GST‑registered moves. Our team assists in preparing and verifying each document to ensure smooth RTO clearance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the car transport service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance with 100 % declared value protection. The policy covers accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards, giving you full peace of mind during the Pune‑to‑Chennai journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle while it’s in transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our carriers are equipped with satellite GPS units that feed live location data to a secure portal. Clients receive a unique tracking link and receive SMS alerts at key milestones, ensuring complete visibility from Pune to Chennai.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the cost factors that influence the price of car shifting from Pune to Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is driven by distance, vehicle size, carrier type (standard vs. enclosed), fuel surcharge, insurance coverage, and any additional services such as door‑to‑door pickup or expedited handling. Our transparent cost matrix breaks down each component for clarity.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer any guarantees against scratches or dents during transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our Zero‑Scratch Guarantee is backed by the hydraulic ramp loading system, 4‑wheel lock, and custom edge padding. In the unlikely event of damage, we follow a swift claim process backed by our full insurance coverage and joint inspection records.</p>
      </div>
